    "q": "If character, behaviour, sin habits, heart wounds and sickness can be changed with proper techniques without God or the gospel, what difference does the gospel make?",
    "short": "Techniques really can change habits, calm nervous systems and heal bodies, and that is good news, because every good gift comes from God. But the gospel is not mainly a technique for self-improvement. It tells you who God is, who you are, forgives and reconciles, unites you to Christ and promises resurrection, which no method can do.",
