    "id": "common-grace",
    "q": "Is healing through therapy, medicine and techniques God’s work too?",
    "short": "Yes. Scripture and the church’s great teachers agree that every true and good thing comes from God, whoever discovers it. Doctors, scientists and therapists share in God’s healing work, often without knowing it, and we can receive their help with gratitude and discernment.",
